OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1786020503
OL,3,CKing of the Netherlands set to pay a
OL,4,Cvisit to Liverpool
OL,6,FThe King of the Netherlands is set to
OL,7,Fpay a one-day working visit to
OL,8,FLiverpool.
OL,10,FHis Majesty King Willem-Alexander will
OL,11,Fvisit the North West during the first
OL,12,Fweek of November, focusing on the
OL,13,FNetherlands' and the UK's 'shared
OL,14,Fcommitment to innovation, defence, and
OL,15,Findustry'. his office said.
OL,17,FThe visit will centre on the use of
OL,18,Finnovative technologies in both
OL,19,Fmaritime manufacturing and the
OL,20,Faerospace sector between the two
OL,21,Fnations.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
