OL,3,CKing of the Netherlands set to pay a
OL,4,Cvisit to Liverpool
OL,6,FDefence and security will also be a
OL,7,Ffocus of the trip.
OL,9,FThe Dutch Royal Household said the
OL,10,FNorth West was chosen due to the
OL,11,Fpresence of high-tech manufacturing
OL,12,Fcompanies, research facilities, and
OL,13,Fscience parks.
OL,15,FLiverpool hosts large-scale maritime
OL,16,Fprojects and is a major hub for the
OL,17,Fdevelopment of innovative technologies.
OL,19,FSeveral aerospace companies are also
OL,20,Flocated around Liverpool.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
